# Generated artifacts.
#
# NOT ibm/bob/artifacts/ — that is hand-written session evidence and the single
# most important thing in the repository for a watsonx judge. An earlier rule
# excluded it, which would have published a submission with its evidence trail
# silently missing.
artifacts/call_sheets/
web/screenshots/

# Downloaded credential files. Confluent Cloud and GCP both hand these out as
# loose files with predictable names, and they land in whatever directory the
# browser was pointed at — which is how a working key reaches a public repo.
api-key-*.txt
*-credentials.json
*-service-account*.json
client.properties
